  "html": "<div class=\"wrap top-in\">\n    <a class=\"logo-link\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Birdline home\"><img class=\"logo-img\" src=\"/img/birdline-wordmark-white.webp\" width=\"273\" height=\"72\" alt=\"Birdline\"></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Site\">\n      <div class=\"nav-item\"><a href=\"/work\" data-page=\"/work\" aria-haspopup=\"true\">Work<svg class=\"nav-caret\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8l5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></a>\n        <div class=\"menu menu--work\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Work\">\n          <div class=\"wrap menu-in\">\n            <div class=\"menu-lead\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Work</span><b class=\"menu-title\">The partnerships, and the work behind them.</b><p>Case studies with the numbers that came out of them, and the reel of commercials, social, photography and design they produced.</p><div class=\"menu-ctas\"><a class=\"menu-all\" href=\"/case-studies\" data-page=\"/case-studies\">All case studies<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-all\" href=\"/work\" data-page=\"/work\">See all the work<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a></div></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-cols\">\n              <div class=\"menu-g menu-g--2\"><b>Case studies</b><div class=\"menu-2col\"><div>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/whoop\" data-page=\"/case-studies/whoop\"><span>WHOOP</span><small>From a social series to a full partnership</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/gardyn\" data-page=\"/case-studies/gardyn\"><span>Gardyn</span><small>45M+ organic views</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/literati\" data-page=\"/case-studies/literati\"><span>Literati</span><small>An always-on creative pipeline</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/solidroad\" data-page=\"/case-studies/solidroad\"><span>Solidroad</span><small>50+ pieces from one two-day shoot</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/686\" data-page=\"/case-studies/686\"><span>686</span><small>Recurring shoots, weekly post-production</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/route\" data-page=\"/case-studies/route\"><span>Route</span><small>Paid social, on time and on concept</small></a>\n              </div><div>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/freepower\" data-page=\"/case-studies/freepower\"><span>FreePower</span><small>15M views, 170K clicks</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/public-rec\" data-page=\"/case-studies/public-rec\"><span>Public Rec</span><small>$53M+ in tracked revenue</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/willies-remedy\" data-page=\"/case-studies/willies-remedy\"><span>Willie’s Remedy</span><small>A three-episode explainer series</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/patrol\" data-page=\"/case-studies/patrol\"><span>Patrol</span><small>12M views in one week</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/edjy\" data-page=\"/case-studies/edjy\"><span>EDJY</span><small>From one launch to a full video engine</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/case-studies/ufl\" data-page=\"/case-studies/ufl\"><span>UFL</span><small>A full season of content, at game speed</small></a>\n              </div></div></div>\n              <div class=\"menu-g\"><b>The work</b>\n                <a href=\"/work\" data-page=\"/work\"><span>Showreel</span><small>Our Birds’ work, featured</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/work#tv-commercial\" data-page=\"/work#tv-commercial\"><span>Commercial</span><small>Hero spots and brand films</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/work#tv-social\" data-page=\"/work#tv-social\"><span>Paid &amp; Social</span><small>Paid ads, UGC and social cuts</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/work#tv-photo\" data-page=\"/work#tv-photo\"><span>Photography</span><small>Stills from our shoots</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/work#tv-design\" data-page=\"/work#tv-design\"><span>Design &amp; animation</span><small>Statics, posts and key art</small></a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"nav-item\"><a href=\"/services\" data-page=\"/services\" aria-haspopup=\"true\">Services<svg class=\"nav-caret\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8l5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></a>\n        <div class=\"menu\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Services\">\n          <div class=\"wrap menu-in\">\n            <div class=\"menu-lead\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Services</span><b class=\"menu-title\">Many ways to make it, one team.</b><p>Every format a campaign needs, from one team inside one workspace. Request any of them on the Monthly Partnership, or scope a production on its own.</p><div class=\"menu-ctas\"><a class=\"menu-all\" href=\"/services\" data-page=\"/services\">All services<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-all\" href=\"/services/production-process\" data-page=\"/services/production-process\">Our Production Process<svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a></div></div>\n            <div class=\"menu-cols\">\n              <div class=\"menu-g\"><b>Video</b>\n                <a href=\"/services/commercial\" data-page=\"/services/commercial\"><span>Commercial</span><small>Hero spots and brand films</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/paid-social\" data-page=\"/services/paid-social\"><span>Paid Social</span><small>Ads for Meta, TikTok, and YouTube</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/ugc\" data-page=\"/services/ugc\"><span>UGC</span><small>Creator-style video for the feed</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/ctv\" data-page=\"/services/ctv\"><span>CTV</span><small>Spots cut for connected TV</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/profiles\" data-page=\"/services/profiles\"><span>Profiles</span><small>Docu-series and long-form YouTube</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/video-podcasts\" data-page=\"/services/video-podcasts\"><span>Video Podcasts</span><small>Multi-cam shoots, cut for every feed</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/film\" data-page=\"/services/film\"><span>Film</span><small>Shot on 8mm, 16mm and 35mm</small></a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"menu-g\"><b>Design & motion</b>\n                <a href=\"/services/design\" data-page=\"/services/design\"><span>Design</span><small>Statics, landing pages, email</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/motion-graphics\" data-page=\"/services/motion-graphics\"><span>Motion Graphics</span><small>Animation, titles, explainers</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/3d-cgi-vfx\" data-page=\"/services/3d-cgi-vfx\"><span>3D / CGI / VFX</span><small>Renders, worlds, compositing</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/illustration\" data-page=\"/services/illustration\"><span>Illustrations</span><small>Drawings and character work</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/ai-content\" data-page=\"/services/ai-content\"><span>AI Content</span><small>Generative visuals and audio</small></a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"menu-g\"><b>Photo, audio & OOH</b>\n                <a href=\"/services/photography\" data-page=\"/services/photography\"><span>Photography</span><small>Product, lifestyle, campaign stills</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/audio\" data-page=\"/services/audio\"><span>Audio</span><small>Radio spots to podcasts</small></a>\n                <a href=\"/services/ooh\" data-page=\"/services/ooh\"><span>OOH</span><small>Events, stadiums, offices</small></a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/production-workspace\" data-page=\"/production-workspace\">Birdline App<i class=\"nav-new\">New</i></a>\n      <a href=\"/packages\" data-page=\"/packages\">Packages</a>\n      <a href=\"/about\" data-page=\"/about\">About</a>\n      <a class=\"nav-login\" href=\"https://app.birdline.ai/login\">Log in</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"top-cta\">\n      <a class=\"top-link\" href=\"https://app.birdline.ai/login\">Log in</a>\n      <!-- TODO: point every \"Book a call\" at the booking flow (Calendly, HubSpot or the Schedule Demo page). -->\n      <a class=\"btn btn--sm\" href=\"https://www.birdline.ai/\">Book a call</a>\n      <button class=\"menu-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"site-nav\" data-menu>\n        <svg class=\"ic-bars\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg>\n        <svg class=\"ic-x\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg>\n        <span>Menu</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
 },
